#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_wiener_filter.ipynb:10002
#: fa5ef89f4da4410c85fed37c32f799e0
msgid "Wiener Filtering: Coherent Noise Subtraction"
msgstr "ウィーナーフィルタ: コヒーレント雑音の差し引き"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_wiener_filter.ipynb:20002
#: 538138e658954b73b7a646166620add8
msgid ""
"A multichannel Wiener filter is useful when several witness sensors contain "
"**overlapping views of the same physical noise sources**. Treating those "
"witnesses independently can double-count the noise and over-subtract the "
"target."
msgstr ""
"複数の witness センサーが **同じ物理ノイズ源を重なって見ている** とき、各 witness "
"を独立に引くと二重差し引きが起きることがあります。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_wiener_filter.ipynb:20004
#: edb3200823df4deb9fdd70ca274e5148
msgid ""
"This compact public case study promotes the legacy MIMO notebook and focuses"
" on the core matrix workflow."
msgstr ""
"この notebook は legacy の MIMO 例を公開 docs 向けに整理し、多入力ウィーナーフィルタ行列の物理的意味に絞っています。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_wiener_filter.ipynb:40002
#: 829388d53fe8483b9446621c00c4d456
msgid "1. Estimate the multichannel correlation matrices"
msgstr "1. 相互相関行列を推定する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_wiener_filter.ipynb:40004
#: 0328e1f07e3b434f8d76f479d6bec21d
msgid ""
"The key point is that the witnesses are not independent. The `Cxx` matrix "
"captures witness-to-witness correlation, and `Cyx` captures how the target "
"correlates with those witnesses."
msgstr ""
"重要なのは witness 同士が独立ではないことです。`Cxx` が witness 間相関、`Cyx` が target と witness "
"の相関を表します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_wiener_filter.ipynb:60002
#: d97b14930a324d48939554dbae1e8a7f
msgid "2. Project and subtract the coherent noise"
msgstr "2. 予測して差し引く"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_wiener_filter.ipynb:60004
#: b6715d698d9544c09fcf4299ec2ec14f
msgid ""
"Only the coherent, witness-predictable part should be removed. Irreducible "
"target noise should remain."
msgstr "差し引くべきなのは witness で再構成できるコヒーレント成分だけであり、target 固有の不可避雑音は残るはずです。"
